@startuml kairos-inbox-message-detail-sequence
title View Inbox and Message Detail

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open Inbox
MemberApp -> API: GET /messages/threads
API -> DB: SELECT MessageThreads for user
DB --> API: threads
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {threads}

Member -> MemberApp: Open a thread
MemberApp -> API: GET /messages/threads/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT Messages in thread
DB --> API: messages
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {messages}

Member -> MemberApp: Type reply\nClick "Send"
MemberApp -> API: POST /messages/threads/{id}/messages {body}
API -> DB: INSERT Message
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 201 Created

@enduml
